# Front-end build output and dependencies.
/dist
/node_modules

# Vite's local env overrides — where the three `VITE_VPAY_*` prefills go.
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Cargo's build directory for `src-tauri`, which is its own workspace root.
#
# Measured 2026-09-22: it does not appear there today, because the repository
# root's `.cargo/config.toml` sets `build.target-dir = "target"` and cargo
# finds that file by walking up out of this directory — so the artefacts land
# in the root `target/`, which the root `.gitignore` covers. The line stays
# because that redirect is not this example's to rely on: build with
# `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` unset and a different config, and the directory appears
# here.
/src-tauri/target

# Written by `tauri_build::build()` on every build: the capability JSON
# schemas (`desktop-schema.json`, `macOS-schema.json`, …), the resolved
# ACL and the generated capability manifest. Regenerated from
# `tauri.conf.json` + `capabilities/` + every plugin's `permissions/`, so
# tracking it would only give a reviewer a second copy of the inputs.
/src-tauri/gen/schemas

# ALL of `gen/`, and the decision is deliberate rather than lazy.
#
# `cargo tauri android init` writes `gen/android/` — a full Gradle project:
# wrapper jar, `local.properties` pointing at THIS machine's SDK, a
# `tauri.settings.gradle` naming absolute paths to every plugin's `android/`
# directory, and `app/src/main/jniLibs/**` holding the built `.so`s.
# `cargo tauri ios init` writes `gen/apple/` — an Xcode project carrying
# absolute paths and a `Podfile`/`Externals` tree that CocoaPods resolves.
# Neither is deterministic across machines and neither is source: both are
# regenerated in full by re-running `init`, which the README tells you to
# do. `create-tauri-app`'s own templates track the generated Xcode/Gradle
# project and then ignore the dozen sub-paths inside it that are not
# reproducible; this example ignores the whole tree instead, because the
# only thing it would gain by tracking it is a diff nobody reads and a
# `local.properties` naming a home directory.
/src-tauri/gen
